  "nodes": {
    "asleep": {
      "text": "(Fast asleep. Best not to wake them.)",
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    "offer": {
      "text": "Elsie Varrow's hip is aching again. She won't say so. She'll just walk slower and glare at the sky.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Is there anything that helps?",
          "go": "offer2",
          "tag": "ask"
        },
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "go": "end",
          "tag": "leave"
        }
      ]
    },
    "offer2": {
      "text": "A warming remedy. Yarrow from the meadow south-west of here, feverfew from the riverbank. Three and two. I'd go myself, but my knees are worse than hers. Will you?",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "I'll gather them.",
          "go": "taught",
          "tag": "quest",
          "actions": [
            {
              "quest": "sq03",
              "type": "start_quest"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not now.",
          "go": "end",
          "tag": "leave"
        }
      ]
    },
    "taught": {
      "text": "Then listen: three yarrow, two feverfew, steeped slow at a good hearth. Never boil it. Elsie will pretend it doesn't help.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "go": "end",
          "tag": "leave"
        }
      ]
    },
    "gathering": {
      "text": "Yarrow's the white clusters, feverfew's the little daisies. Pick, don't pull. Leave the roots and they'll come back. Then steep them slow at the inn hearth, never boil.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "go": "end",
          "tag": "leave"
        }
      ]
    },
    "main": {
      "text": "Feverfew's early this year. Everything's early this year.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Do you sell anything?",
          "go": "end",
          "tag": "trade",
          "actions": [
            {
              "shop": "herbalist",
              "type": "open_shop"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "go": "end",
          "tag": "leave"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}